{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets and Pancakes</strong> is a 5-player co-op survival adventure where pancakes power the universe. Work together to rescue <strong>Professor Pancake</strong>, the galaxy\u2019s only perfect pancake maker, from alien thugs and terrifying monsters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/extras/9a39c68c46ac47d5b1e22590b45cb1a0.avif?t=1764687867\" width=614 height=922 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore strange maps like <strong>Home Away From Home</strong>, <strong>Buttery Swamp</strong>, and <strong>Pancake Laboratories</strong> (with more to come). Survive unique monsters\u2014The Mimic, Bubbles, The Snag, and The Booger\u2014each with their own twisted gimmick.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/extras/0e3cb2431fda6fef37fd70c48aee242b.avif?t=1764687867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/extras_big/0e3cb2431fda6fef37fd70c48aee242b.webp?t=1764687867 width=1560 height=626 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use goofy gadgets like the <strong>Fart Gun</strong>, <strong>Butter Pad</strong>, and <strong>Syrup Bottle</strong> to escape danger, and hack terminals to unlock Professor Pancake\u2019s cell. Fail too many times and alarms will bring monsters running.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/extras/bcb8f1dadfbda6a938d2cf0a17ea6b89.avif?t=1764687867\" width=1560 height=967 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect <strong>Pancake Points</strong> to buy cosmetics and upgrades, gather materials for the <strong>Pancake Antidote</strong>, and fight through chaotic traps\u2014some chests even turn you into a pancake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/extras/60f70ef9aba627b76cd525fb7774e6a9.avif?t=1764687867\" width=721 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Teamwork, Timing, and Pancakes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037460?t=1764687867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/7d71ba26039204a035f3b62774c4638207ef13a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764687867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/c84e013499fa3e1a360495f168947151e43a4db7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764687867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037460/c84e013499fa3e1a360495f168947151e43a4db7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764687867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planets and Pancakes</strong> is a 5-player co-op survival adventure where pancakes power the universe. Work together to rescue <strong>Professor Pancake</strong>, the galaxy\u2019s only perfect pancake maker, from alien thugs and terrifying monsters.</p><h2 class=\"b